    "statement": "Several forest management actions have been associated with increases in understory plant richness and/or diversity.",
    "citations": []
  },
  {
    "statement": "In some studies, logging or removing trees increased understory plant density or cover.",
    "citations": [
      "1273"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "In some studies, logging or removing trees increased species richness or diversity.",
    "citations": [
      "1273"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Other studies on logging or removing trees reported no or mixed effects on understory plants.",
    "citations": [
      "1273"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "One replicated study comparing summer versus winter logging found the season of harvest had no effect on plant species richness or diversity.",
    "citations": [
      "1216"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "In a majority of studies, thinning trees increased understory density or cover.",
