    "statement": "Girdling to thin trees increased understory plant species richness, diversity, and cover in one before-and-after trial.",
    "citations": [
      "1226"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Vegetation removal combined with mechanical soil disturbance increased understory cover and diversity in some studies.",
    "citations": [
      "1274"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Vegetation removal combined with mechanical soil disturbance decreased shrub cover in one study.",
    "citations": [
      "1274"
    ]
